      "updated": 1792669076802,
      "created": 1790291667935,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Order Processing System:\n\n- User places an order (cart → checkout).\n- User views order status and history.\n- User cancels an order before it ships.\n- Inventory is reserved, and released if the order fails.\n- Payment is processed, and refunded on cancel.\n- The chatbot answers order and FAQ queries using RAG.\n\nnon-functional requriments:\n- Reliability: 99.9% uptime, retries with backoff, no order lost.\n- Strong consistency: no overselling; inventory and payment stay\natomic via Saga.\n- an Idempotency-Key on POST /orders prevents double charges.\n- stateless services that scale horizontally.\n\nCAP choice: CP, preferring consistency over availability for orders\nand payments.\n\n\nDesign:\nDRY\nKISS\nYAGNI\nSOLID\nStrangler Fig\n\nCaching:\ncache aside and HTTP Cache\nCache Stampede (singleflight)\n\nAI Bot:\nHallicination Guard rails\nRAG with TF-IDF and cosine similarity with local scope and small\nchunks with less indexes\n\nLocking:\nHybrid [optimistics and pessimistic]\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "myHmduwLSzCOZzZV4ZkBp",
      "originalText": "Order Processing System:\n\n- User places an order (cart → checkout).\n- User views order status and history.\n- User cancels an order before it ships.\n- Inventory is reserved, and released if the order fails.\n- Payment is processed, and refunded on cancel.\n- The chatbot answers order and FAQ queries using RAG.\n\nnon-functional requriments:\n- Reliability: 99.9% uptime, retries with backoff, no order lost.\n- Strong consistency: no overselling; inventory and payment stay atomic via Saga.\n- an Idempotency-Key on POST /orders prevents double charges.\n- stateless services that scale horizontally.\n\nCAP choice: CP, preferring consistency over availability for orders and payments.\n\n\nDesign:\nDRY\nKISS\nYAGNI\nSOLID\nStrangler Fig\n\nCaching:\ncache aside and HTTP Cache\nCache Stampede (singleflight)\n\nAI Bot:\nHallicination Guard rails\nRAG with TF-IDF and cosine similarity with local scope and small chunks with less indexes\n\nLocking:\nHybrid [optimistics and pessimistic]\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
